[[2047,127,536936448,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238808\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238912\">7050A13</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238913\">7050A15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238939\">7050B18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238936\">7050B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238941\">7050B30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238934\">7050A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238926\">7050A43</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the locking pin.</p><p>2. Remove the locking pin with cable.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019449.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,536936448,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the locking pin with cable is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Fit the locking pin in position and fix\nit using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238926\">7050A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238934\">7050A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238941\">7050B30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238936\">7050B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238939\">7050B18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238913\">7050A15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238912\">7050A13</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238808\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p>Check that the locking bolt is working\nproperly.</p>"]]